sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Explorer / Student
    participant UI as Module View / Component
    participant Store as Zustand Store (useAppStore)
    participant Service as SpaceDataProvider (spaceService)
    participant LocalData as Local Datasets (data/*.ts & data/json/*.json)

    User->>UI: Select Celestial Target (e.g. Mars)
    UI->>Store: setSelectedPlanetId('mars')
    Store-->>UI: State Updated (selectedPlanetId = 'mars')
    UI->>Service: getPlanetById('mars')
    activate Service
    Service->>LocalData: Query planetsData.find(id === 'mars')
    LocalData-->>Service: Return Planet Record
    Service-->>UI: Resolve Promise with Planet Object
    deactivate Service
    UI->>UI: Render 3D Viewport, Telemetry HUD & Atmosphere Bars
    UI-->>User: Display Planet Dossier

